IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TAXCALC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TAXREC.
       01 WS-RATE PIC V9999 COMP-3 VALUE .0825.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-AMOUNT PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
       01 LK-TAX PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
       01 LK-RC PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-AMOUNT LK-TAX LK-RC.
       CALCULATE-TAX.
           COMPUTE LK-TAX ROUNDED = LK-AMOUNT * WS-RATE
           MOVE 0 TO LK-RC
           GOBACK.
